This is a tileset i've been sitting on for some time, and since I just
started playing nethack again, I thought I'd share them. Its basically
the origional Itakura 32x32 tiles that come packaged with the latest
version of NetHack (can also be found at http://rltiles.sf.net),
except made the following changes and additions:

a) Removed all the remaining "low res" tiles and replaced them with
other tiles, most often from the crawl tileset.

b) Replaced some tiles i didnt like with ones i like, or at least dont
like less.

c) Given everything single pixel black border - dont ask me why, i
dont know. looks good though.

d) Made small through to significant changes to most remaining tiles,
some have had a complete workover.

Note: To modify some of the tiles I have used resources i can no
longer
locate for confirmation of licence. As such, one or more tiles may be
in
breach of the licence from which they origionally came. If you notice
any tiles that fit this description I will gladly remove them for
something
different. Sorry!

To enusre they work, remember to add the following line to the
defaults.nh file:
OPTIONS=tile_file:nh32adv.bmp, tile_width:32, tile_height:32

You can find the tiles here: http://www.users.on.net/~rossn/nh32adv.rar
I will not host them here forever, though i can pretty much guarantee
at least 6 months, so I encourage anyone who has a nethack site to
pick them up and store them there as well.

